{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"```systemverilog\nmodule event_parity (\n    input  clk,\n    input  rst_n,\n    input  din,\n    output q\n);\n\n    localparam S0 = 1'b0;\n    localparam S1 = 1'b1;\n\n    reg state;\n    reg next_state;\n\n    always @(*) begin\n        case (state)\n            S0: begin\n                if (din)\n                    next_state = S1;\n                else\n                    next_state = S0;\n            end\n            S1: begin\n                if (din)\n                    next_state = S0;\n                else\n                    next_state = S1;\n            end\n            default: next_state = S0;\n        endcase\n    end\n\n    always @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin\n        if (!rst_n)\n            state <= S0;\n        else\n            state <= next_state;\n    end\n\n    assign q = (state == S1);\n\nendmodule\n```"}}
